{"ID":"20260916183232-s0tvsza","Spec":"3","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260916183232-s0tvsza","tags":"乱写诗词,好想她,emo文案","title":"与故人梦中叙","type":"doc","updated":"20260916183415"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916183232-e0fyof4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916183232-e0fyof4","updated":"20260916183232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"浮光浓，烟云瘦，小火浊酒须风骤。旅人莫恐失路久，灞陵城外山青楼。"},{"Type":"NodeHardBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"南北飞鸿多留意，年年应有花相似。春去去，犹怜红，孤洲杜宇唤春留。"}]},{"ID":"20260916183232-4jes2aa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916183232-4jes2aa","updated":"20260916183232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"烟云浓，浮光瘦，小火浊酒须风骤。旅人莫恐失路久，青山城外尚山青。"},{"Type":"NodeHardBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"南北飞鸿多留意，年年应有花相近。捎吾信，捎吾信，莫言白雪笼天地。"}]}]}